%% MosaicKit – mosaic generation sequence (file output)
sequenceDiagram
  participant App
  participant Coord as MosaicGeneratorCoordinator
  participant Gen as MetalMosaicGenerator (actor)
  participant Lay as LayoutProcessor
  participant Thumb as ThumbnailProcessor
  participant AV as AVAssetImageGenerator
  participant GPU as MetalImageProcessor
  participant FS as OutputTransaction
  App->>Coord: generateMosaic(for:config:progress)
  Coord->>Gen: setProgressHandler + generate()
  Gen->>Gen: config.validate(), skip-if-exists check
  Gen->>Lay: calculateThumbnailCount + calculateLayout
  Gen->>Thumb: createMetadataHeader (optional)
  Gen->>Thumb: processedFramesStream(layout)
  Thumb->>AV: images(for: times) (batched)
  AV-->>Thumb: CGImage frames
  Thumb-->>GPU: (index, labeled image) via AsyncThrowingStream
  GPU->>GPU: sample 5 → DominantColors gradient bg
  GPU->>GPU: 20-frame command buffers → barrier → readback
  GPU-->>Gen: CGImage mosaic
  Gen->>Gen: Color DNA + watermark (CPU)
  Gen->>FS: encode to staging → commit (rename)
  Gen-->>Coord: URL
  Coord-->>App: MosaicGenerationResult
